(7698518, 1262842, 173844, '<td valign="top">The foreground is beautifully extracted, if that''s an appropriate word, from its busy, finer-grained context.  Its sumptuous produce is elegantly displayed, upswept and inviting.  The two women''s contemplation of the fruit and vegetables enliven the immediate theme.  The flurry of lines in the image induces one''s vision to dance along in fascination.  It just feels good.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'The foreground is beautifully extracted, if that''s an appropriate word, from its busy, finer-grained context.  Its sumptuous produce is elegantly displayed, upswept and inviting.  The two women''s contemplation of the fruit and vegetables enliven the immediate theme.  The flurry of lines in the image induces one''s vision to dance along in fascination.  It just feels good.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-08-04 11:39:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7698519, 1263072, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, radiant study of radishes.  The reds, in range and glisten, declare their glory.  How they fill the frame bespeaks abundance, abundance of sunlight and soil, generosity, calm.  The cardboard containers, too, seem woven from the earth itself.  You do for radishes what Cezanne did for apples.<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.  Slipped up here -- 8, should have been 10.</td>', 'Gorgeous, radiant study of radishes.  The reds, in range and glisten, declare their glory.  How they fill the frame bespeaks abundance, abundance of sunlight and soil, generosity, calm.  The cardboard containers, too, seem woven from the earth itself.  You do for radishes what Cezanne did for apples.Personal co-favorite of the challenge.  Slipped up here -- 8, should have been 10.', '2021-08-04 11:55:42.000000', NULL, 0),
